'''MERRY CATMAS!''' (クリスマスイベント, ''Kurisumasu Ibento'', '''Christmas Event''') was the Christmas event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]].

==Event Information==
Xmas is back in the Empire of Cats! Let's celebrate the holidays with seasonal Ubers and special stages!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''December 13th (11am) through 27th, 2021 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●The Return of Xmas Capsules!'''}}<br>
The lovely gals of the Cyber Academy get all dressed up for the winter holidays! This return of these limited edition seasonal capsules also introduces new {{Color|#FF00FF|'''True Forms'''}} for Uber Rare heroes {{Color|#34A853|'''KEIJI CLAUS'''}} and {{Color|#4A86E8|'''YULETIDE NURSE'''}}!<br>
During this event only, you can collect all of the Xmas Gals and friends and put their Uber might to work for your Cat army!

{{Color|#34A853|'''・KEIJI CLAUS: Bringing the wrath of heaven on bad kids!'''}}<br>
Tough vs Red, grows stronger after taking damage!<br>
Plus, nullifies Wave damage!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''・SNOW ANGEL TWINSTARS: A relentless smackdown of festive cheer! (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Massive damage to Floating & Angel enemies!<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''・YULETIDE NURSE: Bearing the sacred hopes of all Catkind! (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Slow & knockback versus stingy Angels and Aliens.<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・FROSTY KAI: Clumsy but charming cutie-pie of the ski slopes! (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Her Xmas spirit is tough against Alien attacks!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''・SANTA KUU: Fearless and feisty in the face of winter! (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Santa's li'l helper, tough versus Aliens and Angels!<br>
{{Color|#34A853|'''・HOLY COPPERMINE: Her chilly attitude hides warm holiday wishes! (Uber Rare)Angels and Aliens freeze before her holy power!'''}}<br>
Don't miss out on your chance to get these awesome seasonal units!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Return of Limited Edition Xmas Stages!'''}}<br>
A Reindeer rebellion?!?! Holiday challengers are here to test your skill!<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages to take on the special seasonal map {{Color|#FF0000|'''Jolly St. Nick'''}}!<br>
Can you defeat the holiday menace Blitzen before he rages across the North Pole?

Clearing stages on this map will give you a chance to collect the special unit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''A Gift of Cats'''}}!<br>
Try harder stages later on in the map to get better chances of picking up {{Color|#FF00FF|'''A Gift of Cats'''}} upon victory! (Or use a Treasure Radar on any stage for a 100% chance!)

※After collecting A Gift of Cats, visit the Rare Units section of the Upgrade menu to activate it!<br>
※You must be updated to the most recent version of The Battle Cats to access this event.<br>
※Players who have previously collected "A Gift of Cats" cannot collect this stage reward.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Xmas seasonal stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!

※These Special missions can only be completed until December 27, 2021 at 10:59am, so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!

